@TransactionsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087
@Balances_HostAddress = http://localhost:8090
@Statement_HostAddress = http://localhost:8091
@EventStore_HostAddress = http://localhost:2113

### Crear cuenta (201; 409 si el stream ya existe)
POST {{TransactionsAPI_HostAddress}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId": "123"}

### Depositar (200 con balance y revision; 404 si no existe la cuenta)
POST {{TransactionsAPI_HostAddress}}/accounts/123/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 1000}

### Depositar
POST {{TransactionsAPI_HostAddress}}/accounts/123/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 500}

### Retirar (409 si no hay saldo: el evento invalido nunca nace)
POST {{TransactionsAPI_HostAddress}}/accounts/123/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 200}

### Consultar balance (lo sirve la proyeccion de balances)
GET {{Balances_HostAddress}}/accounts/123/balance

### Consultar extracto (segunda proyeccion)
GET {{Statement_HostAddress}}/accounts/123/movements

### El stream en EventStoreDB (system of record, API HTTP)
GET {{EventStore_HostAddress}}/streams/account-123/head/1000?embed=content
Accept: application/vnd.eventstore.events+json

### Posicion del puente ESDB->Kafka
GET {{EventStore_HostAddress}}/streams/publisher-position/head/1?embed=content
Accept: application/vnd.eventstore.events+json
